        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[delay(time=1)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"玛莉娅\"]  唔啊……这撞得也太彻底了吧……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "玛莉娅",
        "content": "唔啊……这撞得也太彻底了吧……"
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_061#2\", name2=\"avg_npc_101\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"老工匠\"]  都怪老弗。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老工匠",
        "content": "都怪老弗。"
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_120\", name2=\"avg_npc_061#2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"老骑士\"]  我……你……玛莉娅，少听他胡扯，这事儿真不能赖我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老骑士",
        "content": "我……你……玛莉娅，少听他胡扯，这事儿真不能赖我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_120\", name2=\"avg_npc_061#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"玛莉娅\"]  行啦行啦，等我再检查一下，嘿咻——！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "玛莉娅",
        "content": "行啦行啦，等我再检查一下，嘿咻——！"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_120\", name2=\"avg_npc_101#2\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"老工匠\"]  听见没？吵着丫头了，少说几句吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老工匠",
        "content": "听见没？吵着丫头了，少说几句吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_120#2\", name2=\"avg_npc_101#2\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"老骑士\"]  你！！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "老骑士",
        "content": "你！！"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_061#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"玛莉娅\"]  线路，OK，但发动机还没是有反应，唔，这是上上代的产品了吧，是这样驱动的吗……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "玛莉娅",
        "content": "线路，OK，但发动机还没是有反应，唔，这是上上代的产品了吧，是这样驱动的吗……"
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"玛莉娅\"]  引擎没有反应，那干脆手动法术点火试试……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "玛莉娅",
        "content": "引擎没有反应，那干脆手动法术点火试试……"
    },
